---
// The brass plate by the door. Who bakes here, and why.
---
<div class="plaque">
  <span class="screw tl" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="screw tr" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="screw bl" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="screw br" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <p class="who">Baked by loafofbread and DigitalEagle.</p>
  <p class="why">A loaf and an eagle, and everything they like to build together.</p>
</div>
<style>
  .plaque { position: relative; padding: 22px 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; color: #3d2a08; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e9c877 0%, #c9983c 38%, #f3dc9a 52%, #b98a30 78%, #e2bd63 100%); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(42, 38, 34, 0.3), inset 0 0 0 3px rgba(61, 42, 8, 0.35), inset 0 0 0 5px rgba(255, 240, 190, 0.5); }
  .who { font-family: var(--font-sign); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0 0 4px; font-variation-settings: "SOFT" 100, "WONK" 1; }
  .why { margin: 0; font-style: italic; font-family: var(--font-sign); font-size: 1.02rem; }
  .screw { position: absolute; width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #fbe9b4, #7d5a17); }
  .tl { top: 8px; left: 8px; } .tr { top: 8px; right: 8px; } .bl { bottom: 8px; left: 8px; } .br { bottom: 8px; right: 8px; }
</style>
